    "detailed_description": "Paradox Wrench is a first person puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have agreed to be part of an undisclosed experiment.  You will be equipped with a special weapon-like tool. This tool has the ability to switch the physical dimension of certain objects, as well as your own. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is the normal dimension, which you are used. It collides with everything.  Then there is a blue and an orange dimension. These dimensions only collide with the same color/dimension as well as the normal dimension. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will have to discover how this strange tool works, using your wit to complete intricate tests.",
